This package contains the generic Perl-core agent skills.

The canonical source is ../../perl/.agents/skills/. Generic skills use perl-*
names. XPerl-specific skills use xperl-* names and are mirrored separately in
../xperl_agents/skills/. They are a supplement for XPerl checkouts.

From the perl_core_skillz repository root:

    ./sync-agent-skills --check
    ./sync-agent-skills --sync
    ./sync-agent-skills --sync --from-mirror /path/to/perl

Add --xperl only when maintaining or restoring XPerl guidance.
